error[retry-write] 2:58-2:111
  (retry {:delays [1s] :on [Timeout RateLimited Conflict]} (call mail.send {:to "ops@example.com" :subject "x"}))
                                                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  retry may repeat mail.send, which is a write that is not idempotent, and Timeout leaves it unknown whether the write happened.
  Only the kinds RateLimited, NotFound, PermissionDenied, Invalid, and Conflict mean the service did not perform the operation.
  Here :on [RateLimited Conflict] alone would be allowed.
  Fix: :on [RateLimited Conflict]
  Help: sx help retry
